    "detailed_description": "<strong>Play together!</strong><br>Compatible with up to 8 players online or 4 players offline. (Up to 8 players can play together offline if controllers are shared.)<br>Play with your friends online in real time! If you're a few players short, you can even play with random players or the CPU, too.<br><br><strong>Play solo!</strong><br>Get matched with random players online or play offline against the CPU. (Not all games support offline solo play)<br><br>Filled with our most popular games that even newcomers can get excited about. From competitive games to drawing and cooperative games...this compilation has it all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Sea Adventure</h2>Worldwide bestseller with over 200,000 units sold!<br>A great game we recommend even for beginners, in a classic, easy-to-play board game style.<br>- Support Players: Offline 1-6 Players, Online 1-6 Players (Support CPU)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A fake artist goes to NY</h2>To put it simply\u2026.&quot;Drawing&quot; + &quot;Social Deduction&quot;!<br>A popular drawing party game that will make a big group get excited quick.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 3-8 Players, Online 3-8 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Startups</h2>With just 3 cards in your hand you can change your destiny!<br>With some luck and some clever thinking, this is a competitive card game that can be played again and again.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-4 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moon Adventure</h2>A cooperative game that will test your teamwork!<br>A group of astronauts take on a dangerous mission to collect supplies while struggling to replenish their oxygen.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1-5 Players, Online 1-5 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Face, That Face?</h2>Make the facial expression on the theme card and get the players to guess!<br>A party game where you make a bunch of faces.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 3-8 Players, Online 3-8 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In A Grove</h2>One of Oink Games' most respected works!<br>A game of guessing, deception, and for some reason, differing testimonies.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-5 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fafnir</h2>To get the valuable gems, throw something out!<br>An easy-to-play game of strategy that will make you think a little.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-4 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Play together!</strong><br>Compatible with up to 8 players online or 4 players offline. (Up to 8 players can play together offline if controllers are shared.)<br>Play with your friends online in real time! If you're a few players short, you can even play with random players or the CPU, too.<br><br><strong>Play solo!</strong><br>Get matched with random players online or play offline against the CPU. (Not all games support offline solo play)<br><br>Filled with our most popular games that even newcomers can get excited about. From competitive games to drawing and cooperative games...this compilation has it all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Sea Adventure</h2>Worldwide bestseller with over 200,000 units sold!<br>A great game we recommend even for beginners, in a classic, easy-to-play board game style.<br>- Support Players: Offline 1-6 Players, Online 1-6 Players (Support CPU)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A fake artist goes to NY</h2>To put it simply\u2026.&quot;Drawing&quot; + &quot;Social Deduction&quot;!<br>A popular drawing party game that will make a big group get excited quick.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 3-8 Players, Online 3-8 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Startups</h2>With just 3 cards in your hand you can change your destiny!<br>With some luck and some clever thinking, this is a competitive card game that can be played again and again.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-4 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moon Adventure</h2>A cooperative game that will test your teamwork!<br>A group of astronauts take on a dangerous mission to collect supplies while struggling to replenish their oxygen.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1-5 Players, Online 1-5 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Face, That Face?</h2>Make the facial expression on the theme card and get the players to guess!<br>A party game where you make a bunch of faces.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 3-8 Players, Online 3-8 Players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In A Grove</h2>One of Oink Games' most respected works!<br>A game of guessing, deception, and for some reason, differing testimonies.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-5 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fafnir</h2>To get the valuable gems, throw something out!<br>An easy-to-play game of strategy that will make you think a little.<br>- Supported Players: Offline 1 Player, Online 1-4 Players (Playable with CPU opponents)",
    "short_description": "Selling over 1,000,000 copies worldwide, the continually growing game maker, Oink Games, has brought their works to Steam! Play 7 popular board games in a variety of situations. With family, with friends, or even by yourself.",
